YKf0uaO85iHl|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952431982c87d29aa7a269992328dd","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/metrics/service_metrics.csv#6477]\n1:timestamp,service,http_5xx_rate,http_401_rate,p95_ms,cpu_pct,notes\n2:2026-03-22T14:00:00Z,checkout-web,0.2,0.1,410,48,baseline\n3:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z,checkout-web,0.4,18.7,2400,52,checkout submits rejected after payment auth\n4:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z,payment-api,0.5,21.2,1800,49,auth dependency returning invalid issuer\n5:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z,auth-gateway,0.1,28.4,230,41,jwks cache miss and issuer mismatch\n6:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z,orders-db,0.0,0.0,35,86,cpu spike but query latency normal\n7:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z,cdn-edge,4.8,0.0,120,33,static asset 5xx isolated to images"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/metrics/service_metrics.csv"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159025709},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_lPuO3KlfXOr64krGBA75mOTl|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952431983487d2afc4d4286b12c17a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/logs/checkout-web.log#79B2]\n1:2026-03-22T14:09:41Z error submit_order failed status=401 upstream=payment-api request_id=req-8812\n2:2026-03-22T14:10:03Z warn dependency payment-api returned auth_failed invalid issuer for checkout session cko-17\n3:2026-03-22T14:10:45Z info static assets served normally after retry; user checkout flow still blocked"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/logs/checkout-web.log"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159025709},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_8wVvmm7DnOC7WOA94oQESk7A|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952431983c87d2aefc0c0f72210f5a","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/logs/payment-api.log#26AB]\n1:2026-03-22T14:08:59Z warn token validation failed upstream=auth-gateway reason=issuer_not_allowed issuer=partner-v2\n2:2026-03-22T14:09:04Z error create_payment rejected request_id=req-8812 auth_result=invalid_issuer\n3:2026-03-22T14:11:11Z info order-db dependency not used before auth gate for failing requests"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/logs/payment-api.log"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159025709},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ul1p0k5gjWjPz3YbqqnbJyac|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952431984487d2bc4ee8a0baa97a6c","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/logs/auth-gateway.log#3C19]\n1:2026-03-22T14:05:12Z info deployed change_id=AUTH-2026-0318 jwks_namespace=partner-v2 issuer=partner-v2\n2:2026-03-22T14:08:33Z warn jwks cache lookup miss namespace=partner-v2 fallback=partner-v1\n3:2026-03-22T14:08:34Z error validation failed reason=issuer_not_allowed token_issuer=partner-v2 allowed_issuers=partner-v1\n4:2026-03-22T14:12:02Z warn rollback candidate: restore allowed_issuers partner-v2 or revert AUTH-2026-0318"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/logs/auth-gateway.log"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159025709},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_ZecUxIvo02FIuwejGpwoG8gj|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952431988487d2a6fabb43ac17d5d7","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[in/logs/orders-db.log#F6DF]\n1:2026-03-22T14:10:00Z warn cpu_high cpu=86 pct maintenance=vacuum\n2:2026-03-22T14:10:30Z info p95_query_ms=35 connections=64 errors=0\n3:2026-03-22T14:11:00Z info no failed checkout transaction reached orders-db for request_id=req-8812"}],"details":{"meta":{"source":"/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log","sourcePath":"/workspace/in/logs/orders-db.log"}},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159025709},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Deciding output path and incident ID scheme**\n\n**Defining affected services and writing files**","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952432b4fc87d29875b9f59b4dcfbb\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"content\":[],\"encrypted_content\":\"<PROVIDER_ENCRYPTED_PAYLOAD_REDACTED>\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Deciding output path and incident ID scheme**\"},{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Defining affected services and writing files**\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"The fixture paths resolve inside this sandbox as `/workspace/in/...`; the user-supplied `/Users/...` prefix is not mounted. I found a direct causal chain: `checkout-web → payment-api → auth-gateway`, with the auth change followed by issuer rejection. Orders DB and CDN signals are independently explained and not causal. I’ll write the requested artifacts under `/workspace/out`, the sandbox location corresponding to the requested output directory.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952437441c87d2bb7566c390b8773c\",\"phase\":\"commentary\"}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_Ra61Yzj9YlvebKEjDTquIZyA|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952438db6087d28f8029113e097a76","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json","content":"{\n  \"incident_id\": \"checkout-auth-2026-03-22\",\n  \"root_cause_service\": \"auth-gateway\",\n  \"root_cause_change_id\": \"AUTH-2026-0318\",\n  \"confidence\": \"high\",\n  \"affected_services\": [\n    \"checkout-web\",\n    \"payment-api\",\n    \"auth-gateway\"\n  ],\n  \"evidence\": [\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/topology.json\",\n      \"observation\": \"The dependency path is checkout-web -> payment-api -> auth-gateway; AUTH-2026-0318 changed auth-gateway at 14:05Z.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/metrics/service_metrics.csv\",\n      \"observation\": \"At 14:10Z checkout-web had an 18.7% HTTP 401 rate and 2400 ms p95, payment-api had a 21.2% HTTP 401 rate, and auth-gateway had a 28.4% HTTP 401 rate with notes citing invalid issuer and issuer mismatch.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/logs/auth-gateway.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"After deployment of AUTH-2026-0318, auth-gateway used partner-v2 but allowed only partner-v1; validation failed with issuer_not_allowed.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/logs/payment-api.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"Payment token validation failed upstream at auth-gateway with issuer_not_allowed, and the payment request was rejected as invalid_issuer.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_file\": \"in/logs/checkout-web.log\",\n      \"observation\": \"Checkout submit_order failed with 401 from payment-api, and the checkout session was reported auth_failed due to invalid issuer.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"excluded_red_herrings\": [\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"orders-db CPU at 86%\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"The database reported normal 35 ms query latency and zero errors; no failing checkout transaction reached it before the auth gate.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"cdn-edge HTTP 5xx rate at 4.8%\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"The metric notes limit the issue to images, while checkout static assets served normally after retry; this does not explain payment authorization 401s.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"signal\": \"checkout-web and payment-api latency/5xx increases\",\n      \"why_not_primary\": \"These are downstream symptoms consistent with rejected authentication, not an initiating dependency failure.\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"recommended_next_steps\": [\n    \"Immediately restore partner-v2 in auth-gateway allowed_issuers or revert AUTH-2026-0318, following the rollback candidate in the auth log.\",\n    \"Verify JWKS cache namespace and issuer configuration agree across all auth-gateway instances, then retry token validation with a partner-v2 token.\",\n    \"Confirm auth-gateway issuer_not_allowed and HTTP 401 rates return to baseline, then verify payment-api create_payment and checkout-web submit_order succeed.\",\n    \"After recovery, review the change rollout and add a compatibility check for issuer and allowed_issuers before deployment.\"\n  ]\n}\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","usage":{"input":2055,"output":1107,"cacheRead":15872,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":238,"totalTokens":19034,"cost":{"input":0.000411,"output":0.0013284,"cacheRead":0.00031744,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00205684}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1788159025711,"responseId":"resp_0449d91e01a5cb75016a95243211fc87d28dd455cefc3d84f6","rawStopReason":"completed"},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_Ra61Yzj9YlvebKEjDTquIZyA|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952438db6087d28f8029113e097a76","toolName":"write","content":[{"type":"text","text":"[out/root_cause.json#B848]\nSuccessfully wrote 2740 bytes to /workspace/out/root_cause.json"}],"details":{"resolvedPath":"/workspace/out/root_cause.json"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1788159046711},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_RCCWW9zbwW7ocKrWLJIoAv2e|fc_0449d91e01a5cb75016a952447c03087d28aeba7ddfaad298e","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"/workspace/out/triage_notes.md","content":"# Checkout incident triage\n\n## Dependency path\n\n**Directly observed facts:** `in/topology.json` defines the request path as `checkout-web → payment-api → auth-gateway`. `in/logs/checkout-web.log` records `submit_order` failing with HTTP 401 from `payment-api`, and reports that the checkout flow remained blocked. `in/logs/payment-api.log` records token validation failing at `auth-gateway` with `issuer_not_allowed`, followed by rejection of the payment request.\n\n**Directly observed facts:** `in/logs/auth-gateway.log` records deployment of `AUTH-2026-0318` at 14:05Z, setting the JWKS namespace and issuer to `partner-v2`. It then records a cache miss, fallback to `partner-v1`, and validation failure because only `partner-v1` was allowed while the token issuer was `partner-v2`. The same file names restoring `partner-v2` or reverting `AUTH-2026-0318` as rollback candidates.\n\n**Inference:** The production checkout impact began when the auth change made partner-token validation reject the issuer. That rejection propagated upstream through `payment-api` to `checkout-web`; `auth-gateway` and change `AUTH-2026-0318` are therefore the primary root cause.\n\n## Scope and red herrings\n\n**Directly observed facts:** `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` shows elevated HTTP 401 rates at 14:10Z for checkout-web (18.7%), payment-api (21.2%), and auth-gateway (28.4%), with notes tying the latter two to invalid issuer/mismatch. The same file shows orders-db CPU at 86%, but 35 ms query p95 and zero errors. `in/logs/orders-db.log` says no failed checkout transaction reached the database. The CDN 5xx rate is 4.8%, but `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv` says it was isolated to images; `in/logs/checkout-web.log` says static assets served normally after retry.\n\n**Inference:** Orders DB load and the CDN image errors are concurrent, misleading signals, not causes of the checkout authorization failures. The checkout and payment latency/5xx changes are downstream effects of auth rejection.\n\n## Immediate mitigation\n\n1. Restore `partner-v2` to `allowed_issuers` on auth-gateway, or revert `AUTH-2026-0318`.\n2. Ensure every auth-gateway instance uses the matching JWKS cache namespace and issuer configuration.\n3. Avoid replaying failed payments until token validation is healthy; then retry safely under normal idempotency controls.\n\n## Verification\n\n- **Directly observed baseline:** before the incident, checkout-web had 0.1% 401 and 410 ms p95 in `in/metrics/service_metrics.csv`.\n- Check auth-gateway logs and metrics for disappearance of `issuer_not_allowed` and a return of 401 rate toward baseline.\n- Send a controlled partner-v2 token validation test and confirm accepted issuer/JWKS lookup on all instances.\n- Run a controlled `create_payment` request, then `submit_order`; confirm successful responses and that the request reaches orders-db.\n- Confirm checkout-web 401/latency recover without relying on CDN or orders-db changes.\n"}}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-luna","u